{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大暑是二十四節氣中天氣最炎熱的時期，陽氣最為強盛。適逢此時，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">范紀安中醫師</span>提醒大眾需注意消暑及調理脾胃，並可借助「冬病夏治」的概念改善虛寒體質。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>大暑養生注意事項與飲食宜忌</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">平時可多飲用紫蘇茶或薄荷茶消暑</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">保持室內空氣流通。</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食清淡為主</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">應避免食用上火食物。</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">做到早睡早起</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">進行適量運動以穩定情緒。</p></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"79bd746b-07d8-44b1-8978-369c01448bd6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026hWrmymZ2h41784628240.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"79bd746b-07d8-44b1-8978-369c01448bd6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>冬病夏治與天灸療法</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">大暑是一年中陽氣最旺盛的節氣，中醫透過「冬病夏治」，利用夏天的旺盛陽氣去治療冬天容易復發的虛寒性疾病。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天灸療法原理：虛寒體質人士可於「三伏」天及「三九」天接受天灸。醫生多利用白芥子、麻黃、細辛等溫熱藥材配以薑汁，貼於大椎、肺俞、腎俞等穴位，藉此刺激穴位、增加身體陽氣，有助紓緩鼻敏感或哮喘等問題。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天灸注意事項：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">取下藥貼後切勿用冷水沖洗。</p></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>健脾祛濕湯水推介</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">節目中亦推介了一款具有提升食慾、紓緩身體疲倦功效的健脾祛濕湯：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"75e6122e-2cf8-437d-a80c-dcae5d6a99d9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jwwJjpv74O1784628244.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"75e6122e-2cf8-437d-a80c-dcae5d6a99d9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">**本節目內主持及嘉賓的言論純屬個人意見並不代表本台立場。此內容僅供參考。如需獲得醫療意見或診斷，請諮詢專業人士。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T01:19:31.360005+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":432,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}